  "2026-10-14T11:28:07.523Z",codex-agent,"Plan: add the independently authored scheduled thin caller pinned to the audited workflow SHA and matching published extension version. Preserve dependencies, merge-driver scripts, and thresholds. Verify npm and Bun release gates and audits; leave the item open for orchestrator review. No TypeScript functions change, so a function revert regression test does not apply."
  "2026-10-14T11:28:40.823Z",codex-agent,"Before audit: all dependencies 0 vulnerabilities; production 0. No direct fast-glob or jscpd4 devDependency, so dependency manifests stay unchanged. Schedule: 17 3 * * * UTC. Skipped: actionlint is not installed and offline npm fallback is uncached."
  "2026-10-14T12:44:30.767Z",codex-agent,"Validation progress: the existing complete-local-reads acceptance case creates and verifies more than 10000 real SDK items in an isolated tracker and dominates the current npm release check. The check is still active; preserve its full dataset and all coverage thresholds. Do not treat partial progress as a passed gate. Both runtime results remain required before publication."
  "2026-10-14T13:08:14.132Z",codex-agent,"Verification: npm release:check status passed (tests 276; pass 276; fail 0; skipped 0); Bun release:check status passed (tests 276; pass 276; fail 0; skipped 0). Both use a scratch HOME, cleared PM_PATH and PM_AUTHOR, and disabled global/system Git configuration at unchanged thresholds. After audit: all 0, production 0. npm ls braces empty: True. Skipped: actionlint is not installed and offline npm fallback is uncached. No workflow dispatch, merge, release, or bot requests. Behavioural function revert proof is inapplicable to this caller-only change."
